window.products.push({"id":172142,"name":"Lyxa SR Manual Can Opener with Lid Lifter (Stainless Steel with Rubber Handle)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hGHuAJEML._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"It fits all-size cans and can be used as bottle opener and lever. The main body material is stainless steel and it comes with high-quality rubber handles to provide a sure grip. The cutting blade is very strong and won't rust or break while using and will last for years. It has a big knob allows it's user to grip and retate it with ease. This can opener was well manufactured to ensure that its user is safe from any harm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hGHuAJEML._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lyxa SR","source_asin":"B07D449TQV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D449TQV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D449TQV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":172143,"name":"Ner Mitzvah Nickel Oil Wall Menorah with Glass Walls - Fits Standard Chanukah Oil Cups and Large Candles - Ancient Jerusalem Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810WQYU6DSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LIGHT UP THE NIGHT A favorite for so many, celebrating Chanuka is a highlight of the year. Of all the holiday traditions, kindling the Menorah that is the main event. Lighting the candles brings families and friends together to celebrate. Ner Mitzvah's collection of dozens Menorahs help you celebrate the festival right. Choose from a dazzling array of shapes, designs and colors. Whether your choice is classic or funky, vintage or modern, gold and silver or brightly colored, Ner Mitzvah has a menora that suits your taste and style. PRODUCT FEATURES: Every Ner Mitzvah is: Safe and Sturdy Kosher  Made with Premium Quality Materials Durable and Designed for Long Lasting Use CHOOSE YOUR STYLE: Menorahs come in various shapes and styles. Pick which is your favorite: 8 Rounded Branches 8 V Shaped Triangle Branches Wall Menorahs - No Branches CANDLES OR OIL? - Candle Menorahs fit all standard Chanukah candles, and most oil cups with Chanukah candle sized bases.- Oil Menorahs have larger cups to be filled with olive oil, or large wider candles. CLASSIC JUDAICA GIFT These classic and Kosher menorahs make the perfect Chanukah gift for boys and girls, men and women. While the holiday of Chanuka lasts for 8 days a year, menorahs have deep symbolic meaning in Jewish culture & history that renders them part of our shared consciousness. Ner Miztvah Hannuka Menorahs therefore also make great Jewish themed presents all year long. ABOUT NER MITZVAH Family-operated since the 1940’s, Ner Mitzvah is an expert candle-maker, delivering a wide selection of products at the highest quality with personal customer service. Count on us for Shabbat, Havdalah, and Chanukah candles and oil lamps as well as related Judaica.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810WQYU6DSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ner Mitzvah","source_asin":"B076ZT2GZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076ZT2GZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076ZT2GZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":172144,"name":"Cangshan TC Series 1021127 Swedish 14C28N Steel Forged 6-Inch Boning Knife and Wood Sheath Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ubuSNLD5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hand crafted full tang knives forged from fine grained, Swedish 14C28N Steel Steel for incredible durability, stain resistance and exceptional edge retention. 2018 Red Dot Award Winner, German Design Award Winner and Housewares design finalist. USPTO Patented Design. Each blade goes through an (ultra6) stage heat treatment ensuring every blade maintains it's strength and function. Holds an edge up to 5 times longer than German Steel. Well balanced 5.5-inch handle and 6-inch flexible blade ideal for boning or fillet Each Knife comes with carbonized solid ashwood half open magnetic sheath NSF International Certified. Lifetime Warranty against manufacturer defects. Wash knives with warm water and a little detergent, rinse carefully and dry with a towel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ubuSNLD5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cangshan","source_asin":"B075G2SSMB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075G2SSMB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075G2SSMB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":172145,"name":"G2000 Blackout Curtains & Drapes for Bedroom Living Room 63 Inch Length Yellow and Greyish White Room Darkening Window Treatments Ombre Thermal Insula","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ogo0Q1ylL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ATTENTION - Are you tired of so many boring solid colored curtains on the market? Are you looking for something new and fashionable? Look no further, the new G2000 blackout curtains create an unique ombre design to provide you an amazing decor experience. Best purchase you can make today! PACKAGE INCLUDES - 2 ombre yellow to greyish white blackout curtains, each panel measuring 52 inches wide by 63 inches long for a total width of 104 inches are suitable for many large windows throughout the house. Each panel has 8 oil rubbed bronze grommets with 1.6 inch inner diameter which fits most standard rods. VIBRANT OMBRE COLOR - G2000 blackout curtains feature 2-tone gradient colors which adds a beautiful, stylish look to your windows. The ombré effect matches perfectly with different color themed decors, it will really brighten up your bedroom, livingroom, boys room, girls room, kids room, patio, sliding doors and Christmas birthday party. 70% BLACKOUT - New blackout technology helps block up to 70% sunlight and total privacy. Perfect for napping children, day sleepers, night shifters, doctors and nurses. Helps to keep warm during the winter, and keep cool during the summer. Saving you energy costs. EASY CARE - Machine wash cold, gentle cycle, do not bleach, tumble dry low, iron on low heat. Compared to other blackout curtains with chemical coating, our blackout curtains are chemical free and AZO-free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ogo0Q1ylL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G2000","source_asin":"B08VDS1WL6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VDS1WL6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VDS1WL6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
