window.products.push({"id":172227,"name":"Honey Home Modular Storage Cube Closet Organizers, Portable Plastic DIY Wardrobes Cabinet Shelving with Easy Closed Doors for Bedroom/Office/Garage - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i8Jpw7LQL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"★ Material: Eco-friendly & Chemical-free. Honey Home Cube Closet is Made of Flexible & Durable Resin Panels, Supporting By Abs Connectors and Steel Frames. ★ CREATIVE DESIGN: Cubes can be stacked or used separately, and fit into different places with different styles of decoration. ★ SPACIOUS STORAGE: Each cube supports up to 10 lbs, measures is 13.8\"(L) x 13.8\"(H) x 17.7\"(Deep). Hanging sections and storage cubes offer you extra space for heavy outfits and folded clothes. ★ MULTIFUNCTION: All kinds of clothes, books, toys, fabric drawers and other miscellaneous household items. Item comes with 20 cubes and extra 2 hanging rails which meets your different needs. ★ EASY TO MAINTAIN: Waterproof and easy to clean. Dust-resistant wardrobe. Door holes feature is designed for air circulation to prevent buildup odor. ★ HASSLE-FREE ASSEMBLY: Easy assemble and disassemble in a brief time with detailed installation manual provided.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i8Jpw7LQL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honey Home","source_asin":"B07D5S7LZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D5S7LZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D5S7LZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":172228,"name":"Seedling Design Your Own Let It Snow! Holiday Snow Globe Activity Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WVn6CKR4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Create your own winter wonderland scene with this holiday version of one of our best selling activity kits. This kit comes with polymer clay in red, white and green, glitter, a plastic globe, and stand to make a sparkly, custom snow globe. From the Manufacturer Make the World You Play In Our creative activity kits introduce children to new concepts, skills and genres of creativity by integrating their knowledge into new experiences, and allowing them to use it in a holistic way to solve problems or create something new. We create beautiful products that redefine how we shape and understand children’s creative time, and offer nourishing play experiences that value process over outcome, encourage experimentation, and promote decision-making and social interaction. Empower Young Minds We empower children by designing products that put the child in control of the experience, enabling them to create their own adventure. The more imagination you put in, the more ways you can engage with the products. Inspire Creativity We emphasize the value of process over outcome, encourage experimentation with no fear of failure and ensure you can continue to change what you have made. Spark Imagination Our play experiences are powered by imagination. The more imagination you put in, the more ways you can engage with the products. Discover our Wide Range of Creative Activity Kits We offer a wide array of creative activity kits, from DIY dress up to science and space, fashion accessories to DIY tech, and more. Our all-in-one kits come with everything needed for the project, so kids can create their own adventure as soon as they've opened the box. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Play equals experience. How did you come up with the idea for this product? Childhood is an amazing time to learn and build skills, inspire ideas, and let imagination run wild. We recognize that kids want play to be a ‘real’ experience with ‘real’ materials, so we design products based on open-ended, creative play using high-quality materials that offer kids the experience of both making and playing. What makes your product special? Seedling products are designed to put children in control of their experiences, and encourage them to create their own adventures in playtime. We want the children to create what they imagine, not what we tell them to make. What has been the best part of your startup experience? The best part of building and growing Seedling is the people who’ve chosen to take this journey together. It takes a dedicated team to choose the path less-traveled, and there’s great level of admiration and respect among our team members. It’s amazing to look back and see where we've been and what we’ve built, and even more amazing to look ahead at where we’re going—together.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WVn6CKR4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seedling","source_asin":"B00RYAEGUO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RYAEGUO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RYAEGUO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
