window.products.push({"id":172254,"name":"Cosy-YcY Coffee Maker 5-Cup Coffee Syphon / Vacuum Glass Coffee Maker Coffee Brewer (Coffee Syphon)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51msA3oNSWL._AC_.jpg","description":"The coffee syphon’s features: 1: The capacity for 5 cups, could be used for 4-5 people, it is a best choice for family use and festival party. 2: Good quality material: two pots are made of the Heat Resistant High Borosilicate Glass 3: Coffee powder amount choice: for 2 people, we can put 23g moderate ground coffee powder;  for 3 people, we can put 31g moderate ground coffee powder;  for 5 people, we can put 47g moderate ground coffee powder; 4: High-quality U-shaped base, not easy to rust, not easy to deformation, place stable and strong; 5: Alcohol lamp with hood is durable and safe to use; 6: Flannel filter cloth can prevent the fine powder in the coffee powder, remove the miscellaneous taste, and extract the original flavor of coffee. How To Make A Tasty Cup of Homemade Coffee? Step 1: To hook out the catheter of the siphon upper pot with hook on the filter; Step 2: Add water into the bottom pot, wipe the water drops on the surface with a dry towel; Step 3: Light the alcohol lamp, heat the pot and wait for the water to boil; Step 4: After the water boiled, put the upper pot into the bottom pot, put the coffee powder into the upper pot, it is recommended to use moderate ground coffee powder; (or you can put the coffee powder when it begins to inhale the water ) Step 5: When the water begins to inhale, stir about 3 seconds for the first time; Step 6: After 20-30 seconds, take off the alcohol lamp and stir for the second time; Step 7: Coffee liquid begins to back to the bottom pot, take off the upper pot, put the coffee into the cup, you can enjoy homemade coffee The package of the Syphon: 1*Coffee Syphon;  1*Plastic Spoon; 1* Wooden Stirring Stick; 1*Flannel filter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51msA3oNSWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cosy-Yc","source_asin":"B079CMWR8X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079CMWR8X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079CMWR8X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
