window.products.push({"id":172263,"name":"Coffee Roaster, Automatic Air Coffee Roasters Machine for Home Use, Coffee Bean Roaster Machine with Timing, 110V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dFo8Wh6gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product description: Feature: Transparent Cup/ Viewing Window: High heat-resistant glass, the effect of baking can be observed at any time. The detachable accessories are easy to clean, and the scientific design makes the bean skin and coffee beans perfect separation. The roaster provides you with the most original coffee with the most mellow taste. Compared with other machines. The stainless steel used by coffee roaster machine is better, safe, durable and trustworthy. Product Parameter: Material: ABS Plastic and Stainless Steel Product weight: 1.5kg/3.3lb Voltage: 110V/220V Power: 1400W Cup capacity: 80g Color: Black Operation Process: Before first use: wipe the glass with a damp cloth, wipe the glass inside and outside, wait for the water drops to dry before use. Do not submerge the coffee roaster. To reduce the risk of shock, do not soak the coffee roaster base. The coffee bean roaster can roasts about 3 ounces of coffee beans at a time. 3 ounces /80g of coffee beans make 11 to 13 cups of coffee. 1. Weigh 80g of raw coffee beans 2. Pour into the roasting bean cup 3. Press the on / off button to turn on. 4. Press time + adjust the time. 5. After the baking is completed, cool it. 6. Completed cooling, open the upper cover. 7. Rotate the upper cup and remove the upper cup. 8. Pour out the roasted coffee beans.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dFo8Wh6gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANGELLOONG","source_asin":"B08GR41GK8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GR41GK8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GR41GK8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
