window.products.push({"id":172502,"name":"ROSMARUS Shaggy Bath Rugs for Bathroom Non Slip 28\" X48\", Water Absorbent Extra Long Bath Mat, Soft Shower Mat for Bathroom Floor & Tub, Fluffy Plush ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NdX2rPcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microfiber [Ultra Cozy Microfiber]--Crafted from exceptionally soft, velvety, extra thick and luxurious microfiber shaggy rug. Each microfiber pile is about 1.2\" long, making your feet surrounded by thousands of individual microfiber shags. The bath mat perfectly fits the contour of the foot and dispersion foot pressure. Cozy, fuzzy and comfortable, you will enjoy how soft they feel beneath your feet. [Super Absorbent and Anti-Slip Backing]--The microfiber shag bath rug is much more absorbent than cotton bath rugs. The super-absorbent bath rug's microfiber surface quickly soaks up an impressive amount of water and keeps it contained. Non-skid TPR backing has practically slip resistance on the floor surface and helps keep mats firmly in place. [Multi-Size Available]--Measuring size: 17\"x24\", 20\"x32\", 24\"x36\" and 28\"x48\". The microfiber shag bath rug combines new FIBER-LOCKING technology, softer and more density, popular and economical choice when you are seeking something comfortable for your bathroom, and perfect for stepping out of the shower or bath. [FIT MANY OCASSIONS]: This shaggy shower mat brings a selection of gentle colors into your room, no matter in your bathroom, shower, tub, entryways, living room, bedroom, vacation home, dorm room, poolside, or beauty care business, healthcare facilities and even for your pets. Keep your feet dry and protect your feet from cold floors. [Machine Washable and Non-Shedding]--Simply throw your plush bath mat into your washing machine and gently tumble dry on low. It will come out looking as good as new! Plus, Density and plushness pile surpasses that of most other brands. IMPORTANT: please make sure that the mats and floor are completely dry before placement and use!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NdX2rPcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROSMARUS","source_asin":"B0969LKRBB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0969LKRBB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0969LKRBB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
