window.products.push({"id":172619,"name":"800 Thread Count White Twin XL Size Egyptian Cotton Solid Sheet Set of 4, Luxurious Soft & Silky Bedsheet, Fade Wrinkle Stain Resistant, Easy Care Fit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":78.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618WVMhvRVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"TOP QUALITY SHEET SET: These luxurious Dee's Collection 800 thread count sheet set transforms any bedroom into a stylish sleep sanctuary. Twin XL measurement: Flat sheet : 70X105\", Fitted sheet : 39X80\", Pillowcases: 20X30\". Fitted sheet comes with an all-around elastic that fits an 15” deep mattress. Our cotton sheets are super soft and comfortable. SUPER SOFT, FADE RESISTANT & BREATHABLE FABRIC: This 800 thread count sheet set will make you feel like you're laying in the lap of luxury. These bed sheets are built for year-round relaxation! They're moisture-resistant and designed to keep you warm in the winter and act as cooling sheets in the summer. Not only do our bedding sets & collections come in multiple colors, they won't fade even after multiple washes. PREMIUM EGYPTIAN HIGHEST QUALITY COTTON BEDDING: If you love the feel of luxurious cotton bedsheets and crisp pillowcases, you will fall in love with our 800 thread-count Egyptian cotton sheet set. We use fine yarns made with long-staple cotton fiber using a silky soft sateen weave. Sleep better and wake up each morning feeling refreshed and full of energy. Best for any room in your house - bedroom, guest room, kids room, RV, vacation home etc. CARE GUIDENCE: Losing sleep over complicated washing instructions? Well, our bed sheet set is totally machine washable to give you peace of mind! Wash sheets with warm water and tumble dry on low heat, do not bleach. When machine drying, do not dry at high temperatures. Cotton tends to soften up with washing, so allow the sheets a couple washes to experience their silky softness. A portion of profit goes to charity, As a company it is our mission to create love and happiness in the lives of all we touch, That is why we donate a portion of proceeds from each purchase to child's life chances for children charity. By choosing to purchase Dee's Collection for your home, not only you are getting an amazing product at a price you can afford, but also helping improve the quality of life for other children. bed king size duvet covers duvet luxury bedding sets comforter blanket linen reversible sheets decor alternative boho cheap comfortable quilt linens bedding hotel comforters simple bedroom fancy Egyptian cotton wrinkle organic washed duvet cover","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618WVMhvRVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dee's Collection","source_asin":"B09QCSQ327","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QCSQ327","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QCSQ327","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
