window.products.push({"id":172641,"name":"Kitchen Tongs, U-Taste 7/9/12 inches Cooking Tongs, with 480ºF High Heat-Resistant Non-Stick Silicone Tips, 18/8 Stainless Steel Handle, for Food Gril","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lcysjZrvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Not just make it, we upgrade it!] We are a professional kitchenware producer who have been focused on customer experience. In order to offer better and eco-friendly kitchenware, U-Taste collects customer reviews of all similar products on Amazon. And then upgrade the products based on the data of the bad evaluation with the aim to provide customers with more perfect kitchenware products. [18/8 Stainless steel handles & BPA free silicone] 7.89% reviews have received items with poor material and workmanship. Thus, we upgraded the material to 18/8 stainless steel and premium silicone. No need to worry about any strong smell, risk of rusting, color fading, deformation or any other problems like chipping off. With exquisite workmanship, the silicone part is firmly sealed on (will not fall apart easily) and the smooth thick edge shall avoid any hand injury. [Easy & ergonomic locking mechanism] You may have noticed that many tongs are too stiff to open and close, and the grasping is so weak that food always slip out. 38.75% reviews have that problem with their tongs. Therefore, we improved the locking system: good tension on the spring and the sturdy spin to hold it together. Simply hold the open tongs closed and pull the tab out to lock them closed and push the tab in to re-open for grabbing food. [High heat resistant silicone tips without melting & odor] You definitely don't want tongs with metal tips to scratch your pans or tongs with inferior silicone tips that melt easily, like 24.76% reviews. U-Taste upgraded the material to BPA FREE premium silicone with higher heat resistance up to 480°F. Good enough for basic cooking and frying. No more scratch on your nonstick pans and no more worries about the rubber part of the tongs shall melt off with heat again! [Dishwasher safe & easy to store] Food will not stick to the tong so that you can use a quick wipe and rinse it with hot soapy water or just throw them in the dishwasher. They can be locked and stored in your kitchen drawer or hung on the wall with ring for easy access. 28.6% reviews love that. Multiple colors available to match your kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lcysjZrvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U-Taste","source_asin":"B08S7H6M6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S7H6M6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S7H6M6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
