window.products.push({"id":172702,"name":"WONTEX 100% Thermal Blackout Curtains for Bedroom – Winter Insulating Window Curtain Panels, Noise Reducing and Sun Blocking Lined Grommet Curtains fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wu5-UWMCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Total Blackout Curtains are Sold in Pairs: You will receive beige curtain panels. Each panel measures 52 by 72 inches long, both panels have a total width of 104 inches. Our lined curtain panels feature 8 sliver top grommet construction (grommet diameter: 1.6 inch) OUR CURTAINS WILL MAKE YOUR ROOM PITCH BLACK DURING THE DAY: Crafted from 3-layer lined blackout polyester weighted fabric, our heavy and thick curtains guarantee a totally dark room. Bock out 100% of sunlight and UV rays even during the sunniest days. Awesome solution for night shift workers, kids, light sleepers REDUCE ENERGY USAGE WITH THESE THERMAL INSULATING CURTAINS: WONTEX bedroom and living room thermal curtains are an energy saving barrier. They retain heat indoors during the winter and reject heat in the summer, resulting in lower cooling and heating bills. These energy efficient curtains feature a lining attached to their back. The lining is made of a material that is heavy and blocks the sun in the summer or keeps heat from escaping in the winter. NOISE REDUCING AND TOTAL PRIVACY CURTAINS: Being thick and weighted, these WONTEX total blackout curtains provides total privacy they could be used as room dividers or prevent unwanted views and viewers in any room. Because they are so thick and premium, our curtains also considerably reduce noise coming from outside. Perfect for people living in busy neighborhoods SUPER EASY TO CARE: These blocks out curtains are machine washable. Wash with warm or cold water, use mild detergent, no bleaching, tumble dry on low or hang to dry. Low temperature ironing. THERE’S MORE! we have a 60-day easy return policy on these curtain panels if you’re not happy with your purchase","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wu5-UWMCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WONTEX","source_asin":"B07WXHP3VJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WXHP3VJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WXHP3VJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
