window.products.push({"id":172720,"name":"ZMteam Kitchen Mat Cushioned Anti Fatigue Kitchen Rug,Waterproof Non-Slip Kitchen Rugs and Mats Heavy Duty PVC Ergonomic Comfort Standing Foam Mat,Flo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZfRigAtlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Non-Slip & Waterproof】 ZMteam kitchen anti-slip mats have a non-slip texture design on the surface and the bottom to prevent slipping in kitchens or bathrooms, office, sink, laundry, outdoor pools, restaurant, and patios. Our memory foam kitchen mats provide a safe environment for you and your family to work near slippery surfaces. (Open core comfort mat fully and place on even, flat, dry floor. Water under mat may result in slippage. Kitchen mat must be placed on a dry surface during use.) 【Anti-Fatigue Support】 Long-term standing can result in back pain, headaches, and muscle fatigue. But ZMteam extra thick (0.47inch) kitchen anti-fatigue mat can help keep your legs feet, knees, lower back, and joints from being fatigued. Kitchen mat for standing features a cushioned surface that absorbs a lot of the impact your body makes when you walk. This helps reduce fatigue and pain in your feet. 【Multi-Use Floor Mat】 Our kitchen rugs measure 17.3\"x29.5\", the anti-fatigue mat can be used to define different zones for standing in the kitchen, office, laundry room, farmhouse, in front of the sink, or any other indoor or outdoor space. Standing pads are also necessary for a restaurant where you have a lot of workers moving up and down. Bring your kitchen to life with a pop of color and design! Our kitchen mats have 4 colors and a suitable size that fits nicely into the kitchen decors. 【Easy to Clean&Durable】 ZMteam anti-fatigue mat’s surface is easy to clean with a vacuum or wipe down with a damp cloth if it gets dirty. Allowing you to wipe up any spills that may happen in the kitchen. While spills and strains often occur in the kitchen, comfort kitchen mat is sure to clean up easily with a damp cloth or sponge. 【Premium PVC Materials】The ZMteam kitchen mats are made of premium PVC material that is high quality and 0.47inch thick foam. The ergonomics floor mats are constructed with premium strength material to ensure that the mats will keep their shape, even with extended and heavy use. High-density memory foam that reduces discomfort on feet, knees, legs, and back while standing for an extended period.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZfRigAtlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZMteam","source_asin":"B08Y585PQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y585PQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y585PQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
