window.products.push({"id":172760,"name":"MIFXIN Sectional Sofa Covers L Shape Couch Slipcover 2pcs Stretch Elastic L-Type Chaise Sofa Couch Furniture Protector for Living Room Pets Kids (Blac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PgUaapOkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【Sectional Sofa Slipcover】MIFXIN L-shaped sofa covers consist of 2 pieces. One for the chaise and the other for the main sofa. Only suitable for sectional sofas combined by 2 parts separately. Follow the measurement guide and measure the size of your sofa to make sure that our sectional couch covers can match your sofa. Applicable Dimension- 1 for main sofa length: 74\"-90\", 1 for chaise lounge length: 74\"-90\", fit most 3 seat + 3 seat L-shaped sofa. ✔【Protect Sofa & Fresh Living Room Decor】L-shaped sectional couch covers not only protect your couch from stains, wear and tear, but also could turn the old, worn out furniture into brand new one, give your old sofa an entirely fresh new look. Ideal for home with children and pets. Couch covers are fashionable and functional. ✔【High Quality Fabric】Sectional couch covers are made of 92% polyester and 8% spandex fabric, soft & comfortable, wrinkle resistant, highly stretchy and wear-resistant for long usage. Package includes: 2 x couch covers, 2 x pillowcases, several foam pipes. ✔【Easy to Install】Our sofa slipcover is soft highly stretchy fabric, easy to install with the user manual. Come with some foam sticks and the foam sticks can prevent sofa cover from sliding, creating a non-slip and attractive home decor. Tuck the excess fabric into the gap between the back and sitting cushions to make it neater without any wrinkles. The elastic band in bottom will secure the slipcover stay in place firmly. ✔【Machine Washable】Couch covers are easy to clean. Machine washable below 30 degrees Celsius, gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Do not tumble dry. No Ironing. MIFXIN couch slipcovers are in a variety of patterns, you are sure to choose one to match your living room decoration style. Just update your old sofa with our beautiful sofa slipcovers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PgUaapOkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIFXIN","source_asin":"B09CG2QLYN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CG2QLYN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CG2QLYN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
