window.products.push({"id":172967,"name":"Caleca Carousel 16-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AYR7HWSZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Award-winning Carousel pattern, which in 1990 Caleca received the International Tabletop Award, a yellow pattern whose solarity and simplicity is liked by everyone and whose attractive, refined look is adaptable to any environment. Amazon.com Manufactured and decorated by hand in Sicily for over 200 years, this Italian pottery from Caleca maintains a high level of durability, beauty, and tradition. Individually constructed and painted by hand, each piece receives a stamp ensuring its authenticity. With or without the official seal, the brightly saturated colors and whimsically fresh patterns are instantly recognizable as Caleca designs. Four 11-inch dinner plates, four 8-1/2-inch shallow bowls, four 8-1/4 inch salad plates, and four 12-ounce mugs make up the Carousel 16-piece dinnerware set from Caleca. Decorated with a cheerful flair, the sunny lemon yellow interior accompanies bands of bluish purple, rosy pink, and fresh grassy green, while bird-like leaves encircle the inner bowl. This vibrant pattern won the International Tabletop Award in 1990, and is sure to brighten any occasion. Crafted from lead-free, non-toxic clay, all Caleca dinnerware is chip-resistant and can safely be placed in the dishwasher and microwave. --Lea Werbel What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 11-inch dinner plate; 8-1/2-inch shallow bowl; 8-1/4-inch salad plate; 12-ounce mug. 16 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AYR7HWSZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caleca","source_asin":"B000246D0K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000246D0K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000246D0K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
