window.products.push({"id":172977,"name":"VENDOR Ventilated Gel Memory Foam Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NhzG5BTsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sick & Tired With Cheaply Made & Uncomfortable Pillows? Have you been looking for a luxurious, thick and soft pillow that can perfectly mold to the shape of your head and support your spine while you sleep? Who doesn’t! Well, falling asleep doesn’t require any special skills but if you really want to keep your body aligned and your head free of headaches and discomfort, you need a premium memory foam pillow! Presenting The Ultimate Reversible Cool Gel & Memory Foam Pillow By ModvelIt’s not called a “memory” foam pillow for no reason! This gel pillow is able to “remember” you and retain its shape night after night, sleep after sleep! It will instantly conform to your head and body, providing you with unreal support, plus, the hypoallergenic breathable cover can assure maximum hygiene and safety! A Must-Have Pillow For The Entire Year! This reversible memory foam pillow features a cool gel layer on one side for those warm summer nights and memory foam on the other side for cooler, winter nights! The premium memory foam is able to regulate temperature, disperse heat and promote optimal airflow, keeping you pleasantly comfortable all night long. Ideal For All Kinds Of Sleepers! If you love sleep, you will love this pillow! Its 5-inch loft design is ideal for side, back and stomach sleepers and its medium-plush feel is soft enough to keep you extra-comfortable but not TOO soft so as to break your spine’s alignment and cause you headaches or muscle pain. So What Are You Still Waiting For? Scroll Up, Click ‘Add To Cart’ And Sleep In Maximum Comfort Every Single Night!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NhzG5BTsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modvel","source_asin":"B07BX7WYNB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BX7WYNB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BX7WYNB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":172978,"name":"Shower Curtain, Shower Curtain with 12 Hooks, 72 x 72 Inch - Fabric - Waterproof, Green, for Bathroom, Easy to Clean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RsBMUKHeL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Water that is wearing roller skates When I got this shower curtain, I laid it out horizontally on the table. At that time, I was holding a glass of water and preparing to take a sip. I suddenly sneezed, which made me violently shake the glass of water. The water spilled out all over the table, and of course, also on my pants. My pants were like an extremely thirsty child. They desperately and rapidly absorbed all of the water, and I had no time to wipe any of it off. When I looked at the table, I saw that the water that had just spilled on it had not been absorbed by the shower curtain. Instead, it had turned into dozens of droplets of water that were scattered on the shower curtain and that appeared especially dazzling under the lamp’s reflected light. These droplets looked just like diamonds, which I believe was an extremely unusual shape. When I lifted the shower curtain, the droplets acted as if they were wearing roller skates, and quickly slid downwards. You can benefit from our use of high-quality waterproof material for these shower curtains, which allows us to achieve the effect of water quickly sliding off them. Before you install this shower curtain, I recommend that you make droplets that look like gems, and then let them put on roller skates!! Specifications： Material: polyester fabric  Size: 72” Length x 72” Width  Package: shower curtain x 1 , top hooks x 12 pcs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RsBMUKHeL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEECK","source_asin":"B07TWVYT4F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-172978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TWVYT4F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TWVYT4F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
